  "lesson": {
    "code": "1-1",
    "titles": [
      "حساب التفاضل",
      "متوسط التغير"
    ]
  },
  "solves": null,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "order": 1,
      "type": "activity",
      "topic_title": "activity.id",
      "text": "نشاط ١",
      "latex": "",
      "needs_figure": false,
      "figure_description": null,
      "figure_files": [],
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "type": "activity",
      "topic_title": "activity.text",
      "text": "عائلة فلسطينية مكوّنة من: أم محمد وولديها التوأمين أحمد وخالد. كانت كتلة محمد قبل عشر سنوات ٣٢ كغم، وأصبحت اليوم ٦٢ كغم، أما كتلة خالد فكانت ٢٩ كغم، ولكنها اليوم ٥٢ كغم. ارتاحت أم محمد للتغير في كتلة محمد، بينما ذهبت بابنها خالد إلى الطبيب... برأيك لماذا؟",
      "latex": "",
      "needs_figure": false,
      "figure_description": null,
      "figure_files": [],
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "type": "definition",
      "topic_title": "definition.intro",
      "text": "إذا كان ص = ق(س) اقتراناً وتغيرت س من س_١ إلى س_٢، س_١ ≠ س_٢، فإن:",
      "latex": "",
      "needs_figure": false,
      "figure_description": null,
      "figure_files": [],
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "type": "definition",
      "topic_title": "definition.change_in_x",
      "text": "التغير في س يساوي س_٢ − س_١، ويرمز له بالرمز Δس ويقرأ دلتا س.",
      "latex": "",
      "needs_figure": false,
      "figure_description": null,
      "figure_files": [],
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "type": "definition",
      "topic_title": "definition.change_in_function",
      "text": "التغير في الاقتران ق(س) يساوي ق(س_٢) − ق(س_١)، ويرمز له بالرمز Δص.",
      "latex": "",
      "needs_figure": false,
      "figure_description": null,
      "figure_files": [],
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "type": "definition",
      "topic_title": "definition.average_rate_of_change",
      "text": "متوسط التغير في الاقتران ص = ق(س) يساوي Δص/Δس = (ص_٢ − ص_١)/(س_٢ − س_١) = (ق(س_٢) − ق(س_١))/(س_٢ − س_١).",
      "latex": "",
      "needs_figure": false,
      "figure_description": null,
      "figure_files": [],
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "type": "definition",
      "topic_title": "definition.h_form",
      "text": "Δص/Δس = (ق(س_١ + هـ) − ق(س_١))/هـ، حيث هـ = Δس ≠ ٠، ونسميه اقتران متوسط التغير عند س_١.",
      "latex": "",
      "needs_figure": false,
      "figure_description": null,
      "figure_files": [],
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "type": "machine",
      "topic_title": "definition.machine_readable.delta_x",
      "text": "Δx = x2 - x1",
      "latex": "",
      "needs_figure": false,
      "figure_description": null,
      "figure_files": [],
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "type": "machine",
      "topic_title": "definition.machine_readable.delta_y",
      "text": "Δy = f(x2) - f(x1)",
      "latex": "",
      "needs_figure": false,
      "figure_description": null,
      "figure_files": [],
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "type": "machine",
      "topic_title": "definition.machine_readable.average_rate",
      "text": "Δy/Δx = (y2-y1)/(x2-x1) = (f(x2)-f(x1))/(x2-x1)",
      "latex": "",
      "needs_figure": false,
      "figure_description": null,
      "figure_files": [],
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "type": "machine",
      "topic_title": "definition.machine_readable.h_form",
      "text": "Δy/Δx = (f(x1+h)-f(x1))/h, h=Δx≠0",
      "latex": "",
      "needs_figure": false,
      "figure_description": null,
      "figure_files": [],
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "type": "example",
      "topic_title": "examples[0].id",
      "text": "مثال ١",
      "latex": "",
      "needs_figure": false,
      "figure_description": null,
      "figure_files": [],
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "type": "example",
      "topic_title": "examples[0].function",
      "text": "ص = ق(س) = س^٣ − ٥س + ٣",
      "latex": "",
      "needs_figure": false,
      "figure_description": null,
      "figure_files": [],
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "type": "machine",
      "topic_title": "examples[0].machine_readable_function",
      "text": "f(x) = x^3 - 5*x + 3",
      "latex": "",
      "needs_figure": false,
      "figure_description": null,
      "figure_files": [],
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "type": "example",
      "topic_title": "examples[0].questions[0]",
      "text": "جد Δس عندما تتغير س من −١ إلى ٢.",
      "latex": "",
      "needs_figure": false,
      "figure_description": null,
      "figure_files": [],
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "type": "example",
      "topic_title": "examples[0].questions[1]",
      "text": "جد التغير في ق(س) عندما تتغير س من −١ إلى ٢.",
      "latex": "",
      "needs_figure": false,
      "figure_description": null,
      "figure_files": [],
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "type": "example",
      "topic_title": "examples[0].questions[2]",
      "text": "جد متوسط التغير في ق(س) عندما تتغير س من −١ إلى ٢.",
      "latex": "",
      "needs_figure": false,
      "figure_description": null,
      "figure_files": [],
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "type": "example",
      "topic_title": "examples[0].solution[0]",
      "text": "س_١ = −١، س_٢ = ٢، ومن ثم Δس = س_٢ − س_١ = ٢ − (−١) = ٣.",
      "latex": "",
      "needs_figure": false,
      "figure_description": null,
      "figure_files": [],
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "type": "example",
      "topic_title": "examples[0].solution[1]",
      "text": "Δص = ق(س_٢) − ق(س_١) = ق(٢) − ق(−١) = ١ − ٧ = −٦.",
      "latex": "",
      "needs_figure": false,
      "figure_description": null,
      "figure_files": [],
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "type": "example",
      "topic_title": "examples[0].solution[2]",
      "text": "متوسط التغير = Δص/Δس = −٦/٣ = −٢.",
      "latex": "",
      "needs_figure": false,
      "figure_description": null,
      "figure_files": [],
      "uncertain": true
    }
  ],
